  "description": "An engine-neutral console foundation with manager-centered logging and optional log metadata, retained entries, command history, typed synchronous and asynchronous command workflows, streamed output, progress reporting, stateless autocomplete, permissions, availability checks, and configurable help. Workes.ContentSystem provides internal storage while the public API remains ConsoleSystem-owned.",
