  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.13.0 adds typed custom conversion for individual command arguments and options, plus an optional state factory that receives resolved values by ID. Existing built-in value conversions and constructor-based state creation remain the defaults. The package remains backed internally by Workes.ContentSystem and exposes no ContentSystem types publicly. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
